        <dc:description>&lt;p&gt;"Ready to ditch this bar and go somewhere a little more interesting...?"   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It's the end of a long work week, the boys are at home, and the girls are ready to go out and play!   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our newest anthology, "Ladies Night" is packed to the brim with eleven different tales of sensual flair and genuine passion, teeming with characters that are simply begging to get to know you.   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Care to join them for a drink...?&lt;/p&gt;</dc:description>
